    "description": "Close a block: the work is done, a reason is given, or its author withdraws it.
Use when: Close an open block.
When not to use: Use block_answer for a question answer.
Example: {"mode":"done","block":"B13","ref":"example/web#9","idempotencyKey":"block_unblock-example-001"}
Choose a unique idempotencyKey for each action; reuse it on retries.",
